{%- comment -%}
  Detail sheet behind a delivery or guarantee row.

  A promise the shopper cannot inspect is a slogan. Tapping the row opens the
  full terms: for delivery a small table (who carries it, how long, what it
  costs), for guarantees a numbered list the merchant writes themselves.

  Everything here is the merchant's own text. This theme is sold to shops that
  each have different couriers and different return terms, and a policy we
  invented for them would be a promise they never made.

  Params: id, title, icon, rows (table), items (numbered), note
{%- endcomment -%}

<div class="tsheet" id="{{ id }}" data-open="false" aria-hidden="true">
  <div class="tsheet__scrim" data-sheet-close></div>

  <div class="tsheet__panel" role="dialog" aria-modal="true"
       aria-labelledby="{{ id }}-title">
    <div class="tsheet__head">
      <span class="tsheet__icon">{% render 'icon', name: icon %}</span>
      <h2 class="tsheet__title" id="{{ id }}-title">{{ title }}</h2>
      <button class="tsheet__close" type="button" data-sheet-close
              aria-label="{{ close_label | default: 'Fermer' | escape }}">
        {% render 'icon', name: 'close' %}
      </button>
    </div>

    <div class="tsheet__body">
      {{ content }}
    </div>
  </div>
</div>
